<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Imagine you have a power plug from Europe that has a two-pin interface, but your wall socket in Pakistan has a three-pin interface. What do you do? You use a travel adapter. The Adapter pattern does exactly this in software.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [3]
>>
